  "title": "Pork Sausages with Caramelized Onion Sauce",
  "description": "For such a simple recipe with so few ingredients, the flavor here is incredibly deep. The onions come out creamy and are the perfect companion to broiled or grilled sausages. This is excellent served with mashed potatoes.",
